{
  "adds": ["uDecompose", "uDelete", "uConflict", "uEliminate", "uSwap", "uCheck"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "title": { "zh": "六个元件一个框" },
  "builds": "unifier",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "六种元件都有了：分解、删除、冲突、消元、定向、出现检查。这一回每一种都可能用到，用几次、何时用，由等式决定。设计出的证明助手会成为新元件「合一器」。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "合一器求出的是<wiki-ref to=\"mgu\"></wiki-ref>：只确定非确定不可的部分。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-unifier",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "unify",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "等式" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "eqs": ["(?A → ?B) ∧ (?B → ?C) ≐ (Rain → Wet) ∧ (?D → Slip)"] },
        { "eqs": ["?A ∧ (?B ∨ ?A) ≐ Rain ∧ (Wind ∨ Wet)"] },
        { "eqs": ["?A → ?B ≐ ?B → ¬?A"] },
        { "eqs": ["¬¬?A ≐ ¬?B"] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：不管要拆几层、代几次，都把等式解到底；对不上或者没有解的，说「失败」。"
      },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "每种元件都要进重复框。" }],
      "solution": [
        "r = repeat(in, body: c5) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c0 = uDecompose(r.body)",
        "    c1 = uDelete(c0)",
        "    c2 = uSwap(c1)",
        "    c3 = uEliminate(c2)",
        "    c4 = uCheck(c3)",
        "    c5 = uConflict(c4)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
